tion_i18n/jp","1度の戦闘につき、1回まで発動可能。自身または味方のHPが低くなった時、周囲の敵に大ダメージを与え、スタンを付与"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗仅释放一次，当自身或场上任意一名非召唤物友军的生命值低于30%时释放一次怒吼，对全体敌人造成8次50% ATK伤害和0.5秒眩晕。释放期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","1度の戦闘につき、1回まで発動可能。自身またはフィールド上の召喚ユニット以外の味方1体のHPが30%より低くなった時、咆哮を上げ、敵全体に50% ATKのダメージを8回与え、0.5秒間のスタンを付与。スキル発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":75,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":69,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":110,"end":118,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至60% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","眩晕时长提升至2秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","スタンの持続時間が2秒にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが70% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得护盾时可以回复一定量生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","シールド獲得時、HPを一定量度回復"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","获得任意护盾时，立即回复等同于护盾最大值15%的生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","任意のシールド獲得時、シールド値上限×15%分のHPを回復"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时获得的护盾提升至600% HP，为周围2格范围友军承担的伤害比例提升至80%。并且自身从该状态中结束后起身的速度加快50%。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","必殺技の戦闘開始時に獲得するシールドのシールド値が600% HPにUP。周囲2マス以内の味方の被ダメージを引き受ける割合が80%にUP。この状態が終了した後、自身が起き上がる速度+50%"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":25,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","封墓连枷"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","グレイヴフレイル"]]}